  "tagline": "珍珠白机械舱 · 黑曜虎鲸操作员 · 电蓝链路信号",
  "description": "虎鲸链路（ORCA LINK）移植：为原创虎鲸操作员定制的轻量二次元科幻皮肤。珍珠白机械舱、石墨黑结构件与克制的电蓝信号贯穿侧栏、会话与输入区；亮色以眨眼角色迎接新会话，暗色为深海操作台氛围。本版为纯外观移植（manifest-v2 资产皮肤），保留原 bundle 的配色与背景叙事，不含原插件的交互脚本。",
  "tags": [
    "orca",
    "mechanical",
    "monochrome",
    "anime",
    "blue"
  ],
  "accent": "#086cff",
  "order": 15,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "license": "CC BY-NC-SA 4.0",
  "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale/blob/main/orca-link/LICENSE",
  "noticeUrl": "https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale/blob/main/orca-link/NOTICE",
  "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale/tree/main/orca-link",
  "attribution": "Small-tailqwq · ORCA LINK",
  "preview": {
    "light": "preview/light.png",
    "dark": "preview/dark.png"
  },
  "contributes": {
    "stylesheet": "skin.css",
    "backgroundMedia": {
      "light": {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/light-hero-v4.webp",
        "scrim": "linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(248,250,253,0.34) 0%, rgba(248,250,253,0.18) 46%, rgba(248,250,253,0.02) 72%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(248,250,253,0.03), transparent 68%, rgba(239,243,248,0.16))"
      },
      "dark": {
        "type": "image",
        "src": "assets/dark-hero-v2.webp",
        "scrim": "linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(9,13,20,0.10) 0%, rgba(9,13,20,0.32) 60%, rgba(9,13,20,0.48) 100%)"
      }
    }
  }
